      "verse_label": "3",
      "locator": {
        "book": "NUM",
        "chapter": 10,
        "verse": 3
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "NUM",
          "chapter": 10,
          "verse": 3
        }
      ],
      "en": "When they blow them, all the congregation shall gather themselves to you at the door of the Tent of Meeting.",
      "ko": "두 나팔을 불 때에는 온 회중이 회막 문 앞에 모여서 네게로 나아올 것이요",
      "source_text_hash": "0b3cc08175bfec100a7e9d333523d4f20b81581e542b5dbaf30240ae6dd51a4c",
      "translation_text_hash": "709eb6c87df0ab1dca6da09652b06d9345d8adcabeb55264eb554cac3f73e549",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "두 나팔을 불 때에는 온 회중이 회막 문 앞에 모여서 네게로 나아올 것이요"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "709eb6c87df0ab1dca6da09652b06d9345d8adcabeb55264eb554cac3f73e549"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:NUM:10:4",
      "sequence": 3993,
      "chapter_label": "NUM 10",
      "verse_label": "4",
      "locator": {
        "book": "NUM",
