        "verse": 4
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "NUM",
          "chapter": 10,
          "verse": 4
        }
      ],
      "en": "If they blow just one, then the princes, the heads of the thousands of Israel, shall gather themselves to you.",
      "ko": "하나만 불 때에는 이스라엘 천부장 된 족장들이 모여서 네게로 나아올 것이며",
      "source_text_hash": "fbb3dcb04a4e98c83a47e708b51c9c181914ae3483ab0f7b399ececf2a459dad",
      "translation_text_hash": "0e28b2497035994b53fe41f705bb13d76a0e392db0bd4c3fcc4035d1ece3a661",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "하나만 불 때에는 이스라엘 천부장 된 족장들이 모여서 네게로 나아올 것이며"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "0e28b2497035994b53fe41f705bb13d76a0e392db0bd4c3fcc4035d1ece3a661"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:NUM:10:5",
      "sequence": 3994,
      "chapter_label": "NUM 10",
      "verse_label": "5",
      "locator": {
